  "items": [
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"deprecated-label\">Deprecated, for removal: This API element is subject to removal in a future version.</span>",
      "translation": "<code class=\"deprecated-label\">已弃用，即将移除：此 API 元素将在未来版本中被移除。</code>",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "Determines whether the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> is declared on the application classpath and performs the given,\nrequired <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>action</code></a> if present.",
      "translation": "判断 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>type</code></a>` 是否声明在应用程序类路径上，如果存在则执行所需的、给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"java.util.function 中的类或接口\"><code>action</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves the required <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>named</code></a> <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解析所需的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>named</code></a><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>type</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> containing bean names that implement this type.",
      "translation": "返回一个包含实现此类型的 Bean 名称的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determines whether <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> is present on the application classpath.",
      "translation": "确定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>type</code></a> 是否存在于应用程序类路径中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> if present.",
      "translation": "如果存在，则解析 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>type</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determines whether the associated bean factory contains at least one bean of this type.",
      "translation": "确定关联的 Bean 工厂是否包含至少一个该类型的 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "true if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> is present on the application classpath.",
      "translation": "如果 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> 存在于应用程序类路径中，则为 true。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Type-based introspector to resolve <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> from a type name and to introspect the bean factory for presence\nof beans.",
      "translation": "基于类型的内省器，用于根据类型名称解析 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Class</code></a>，并内省 Bean 工厂以检查是否存在相应的 Bean。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "since 4.0 as this isn't widely used and can be easily implemented within user code.",
      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起，由于该功能使用不广泛且易于在用户代码中实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>action</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Consumer</code></a> defining the action to perform on the resolved <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a>; must not be\n         null.",
      "translation": "<code>action</code> - 一个定义在解析后的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> 上执行操作的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Consumer</code></a>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/TypeNotPresentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">TypeNotPresentException</a></code> - if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> cannot be found.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/TypeNotPresentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">TypeNotPresentException</a></code> - 如果找不到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>type</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> value containing the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> if the type is present on the application\n        classpath.",
      "translation": "包含一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Optional</code></a> 值，如果该类型存在于应用程序的类路径中，则该值包含 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>type</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a resolved <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> for the given.",
      "translation": "已解析的给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>type</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of bean names. The list is empty if the bean factory does not hold any beans of this type.",
      "translation": "一个包含 Bean 名称的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>。如果该 Bean 工厂不包含此类型的任何 Bean，则该列表为空。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Christoph Strobl, John Blum, Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "克里斯托夫·施特罗布，约翰·布鲁姆，马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
